              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This panel data set covers 6 waves capped by the Dutch parliamentary elections (Tweede Kamerverkiezingen) of 2017 and 2021. It contains a range of variables common to the regular DPES, including reported voting behavior in 2017 (Lower House), 2019 (provincial), 2019 (European Parliament) and 2021 (Lower House).\nData were collected via the LISS-panel of Centerdata, and can be enriched with additional data from that panel.\n\nTo make use of these data users need to register with Centerdata."
                }
